                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> a resident of </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!houseno.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>, </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Parameters!street.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>, Bubukal for 7 month, is a qualified availee of RA 11262 or the First Time JobSeekers Act of No. 11261.

I further certify that the holder/bearer as informed of his/her rights, including the duties and responsibilities accorded by RA 11262 through the oath of Undertaking he/she has signed and executed in the presence of our Barangay Officials.

Signed this day </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
